%% alt: 9-step exploration order for a first look at a DataFrame
flowchart TD
  A["1. head()<br/>Loaded correctly?"] --> B["2. shape<br/>Size and shape"]
  B --> C["3. columns / index<br/>Column and index names"]
  C --> D["4. dtypes<br/>Data types"]
  D --> E["5. info()<br/>Overall structure"]
  E --> F["6. isna().sum()<br/>Missing value count"]
  F --> G["7. describe()<br/>Numeric distribution"]
  G --> H["8. unique() / value_counts()<br/>Check categoricals"]
  H --> I["9. sample()<br/>Random re-scan"]
